      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, it feels professional. I noticed last year that some organizations actually got flagged because their keyword density was too low for the automated system, even if their writing was great. \n\nCan you try an expanded version? I need about two or three more paragraphs that go into more detail about our specific field methods. Again, please make sure it's high-quality writing, but we really need to make sure those specific pillar terms are well-represented so we don't get filtered out by the bot in the first round.",
